---

Changes made by Para: Foursquare's data reached Para through Overture Maps Places, which
transformed it to the Overture schema. Para keeps only places inside its map's area with
Overture's confidence of at least 0.7, in a few categories (eateries, cafés, clinics, schools);
drops places whose name reads like an address, whose point lies on a road's centre line, or
which OpenStreetMap already has; keeps of each place only a short id, its kind, its point
(rounded to 5 decimals), its name and its brand; and splits them into files by area. See
scripts/overture/ in https://github.com/ParaOrg/Para.
